# Proposed by the executor of F68 (2026-10-15), from what two adversarial readers played; the documenter may edit or drop it.
# Story: somebody who wanted no column for the Desktop does not want a hole for it either. "Whoever is left alone stays as it is" is about the two
# places that everything consists of, however the picture was made. Inside a group the others share; a docked window that is only moved leaves
# nothing over where it was; visitors to the Desktop's view leave no column behind.
# Reference: F68.
quiet
open A
open B
open C
open D
dock 101 left
dock 102 right
# One of two halves is moved: above, and back. No quarter is left empty, and there and back is nothing.
dock 101 top
expect size 101 1416x420
expect size 102 1416x419
expect above 101 102
dock 101 left
expect size 101 702x851
expect size 102 702x851
expect at 102 726 37
# One above the other, whichever way that was made: the one that is left stays.
dock 102 beside 101 bottom
expect size 102 1416x419
float 101
expect still 102
expect at 102 12 469
dock 101 left
float 102
float 101

# Three: a column of two and a third. The column's own close up; no hole opens.
dock 101 left
dock 102 right
dock 102 bottom
dock 103 right
expect size 101 702x420
expect size 102 702x419
float 101
expect size 102 702x851
expect size 103 702x851
float-all

# One that was in the Dock when it closed takes nothing from whoever is there.
dock 101 left
dock 102 right
dock 102 bottom
minimize 101
expect size 102 1416x851
close 101
expect still 102
expect size 102 1416x851
float-all

# Visitors to the Desktop's view: two of them come and go, and the halves are halves.
dock 102 left
dock 103 right
desktop
dock 104 left
open E
dock 105 right
float 104
float 105
show-all
expect size 102 702x851
expect size 103 702x851
# At the edge of that view already, a second press says so.
desktop
dock 104 left
dock 104 left
expect fail
float 104
show-all
expect size 102 702x851
expect size 103 702x851
float-all

# Evening out counts what shows: a Desktop without room is no place.
dock 103 left
dock 104 right
dock 102 top
focus 103
rotate
balance
expect size 102 1416x280
expect size 103 1416x274
expect size 104 1416x273
